cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "若使用本方法或工具，请引用以下条目。"
title: "Park Behavior Mapping: 手绘行为注记图的分段统计工具"
abstract: >-
  面向风景园林专业的公园人群行为观察工具。将手绘平面图上的
  「人数-性别-活动」注记转换为结构化数据，按路段汇总人数、
  性别构成与停留特征，并输出统计图与数据表。
authors:
  - family-names: "Sytsi"
    given-names: "Hon"
    affiliation: "Landscape Architecture"
    note: "标注方法（三编码体系与分段统计口径）提出者"
  - family-names: "Cat0ntheRoof"
    note: "工具实现"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cat0ntheRoof/park-behavior-mapping"
keywords:
  - landscape architecture
  - behavior mapping
  - post-occupancy evaluation
  - park
  - annotation
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
